# Internal working notes must never live in the SOURCE tree — this is a
# public repo. Campaign logs, status boards, handoff docs and audit notes go
# under docs/internal/ (ignored above). Six of these had drifted into
# vmlx_engine/models/minimax_m3/ carrying machine names, branch/PR internals
# and "HOLD all commits" — moved out 2026-08-12. Patterns, not paths, so a
# new one cannot reappear in another model dir.
**/CAMPAIGN-*.md
**/*-CAMPAIGN.md
**/MASTER-STATUS.md
**/BUILD-STATUS.md
**/*-HANDOFF.md
**/*-ROOTCAUSE*.md
**/ISSUE-LEDGER.md
**/*-PROGRESS-LOG.md
vmlx_engine/**/STATUS.md
vmlx_engine/**/NOTES.md
.agents/
AGENTS.md

# Ad-hoc live-UI CDP driver scripts. Every debugging session writes a few of
# these into panel/scripts/; 75 had accumulated untracked on the box, one
# `git add -A` away from landing in a public repo. Ignore the directory's
# .cjs by default and allow-list the real build/release/driver scripts, so
# tomorrow's throwaway probe is ignored without another .gitignore edit.
panel/scripts/*.cjs
!panel/scripts/electron-builder-after-all-artifact-build.cjs
!panel/scripts/electron-builder-after-pack.cjs
!panel/scripts/electron-builder-before-pack.cjs
!panel/scripts/leakprobe.cjs
!panel/scripts/r21drv.cjs
!panel/scripts/release-python-action.cjs
!panel/scripts/uidrv.cjs

# Probe/scratch dumps and local backups at the repo root (d4.txt, x.txt,
# ternary_*_731.txt, dsv4_ui_tool_probe.txt, .pre161-backup/ …). No tracked
# file matches these, so the rules cannot hide real source.
/*.txt
*_probe*.txt
*-backup/
.pre*-backup/
nohup.out
